
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Okuphumayo bhala: laugh, umugqa-omusha.

>> locked := Amanga.
>> security := Iqiniso.
security iqiniso: { locked := Iqiniso. }.
Okuphumayo bhala: locked, umugqa-omusha.

>> n := 7.
(Iqiniso) iqiniso: { n := 9. }.
Okuphumayo bhala: n.
